Did you figure out how to use Dusty the Vacuum?  Just pick him up and hit the
space bar.

Hitting the space bar again turns him off.

If you vacuumed up the bomb, you'll have to get Dusty to work in
reverse to get it out if you need to start over again.

Thanks for trying.  I would pick up Dusty, turn him on and move him over
all the stuff on the floor.  I'd press the space bar as soon as I see
a number pad with 0 on it.

